course: dictionary
lesson: 2448
title: Dancer: a person who dances
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A dancer is a person who dances. Dancing can be a job, like a ballet dancer on a stage, or a hobby you do for fun. The ending -er often means a person who does something, like a teacher teaches and a runner runs.
explain: «Ballet dancers dance en pointe, on the tips of their toes, in special stiff shoes after years of training.» The words around dancer give you clues: ballet, stiff shoes and years of training show it means someone who practises dance very hard.
explain: Dancer has a plural, dancers, for more than one person. In maths you might count dancers in rows, so 4 rows of 6 dancers makes 24 dancers. To check a meaning, put it in the sentence: does "a person who dances" still make sense?
fact: A dancer is a person who dances, as a job or a hobby.
fact: «Ballet» dancers train for years, and teachers wait until their feet are strong enough before they dance en pointe.
fact: «Riverdance» made Irish stepdance world famous in 1994.
fact: «Rudolf Nureyev» and «Mikhail Baryshnikov» are famous male ballet dancers.
fact: Many dancers are shy off stage, and dancing in a group first can build the confidence to dance alone.
exercise: What is a dancer? | A large hall used for shows | A loud drum played in a band | A type of tree | *A person who dances, as a job or a hobby
exercise: A class has 4 rows with 6 dancers in each row. How many dancers are there? | 10 | 46 | *24 | 6
exercise: Find and copy the word that means more than one dancer. | danced | dancing | *dancers | dance
test: «Ballet has many famous male dancers.» Which word tells you the dancers are well known? | male | *famous | ballet | many
test: «Many dancers are shy off stage.» What does shy mean here? | Very tall | Loud and bold | Hungry | *Quiet and nervous around other people
exam: «Sifakas bounce sideways with their arms up, like dancers.» Why does the author say like dancers? | They are learning to read | *Their moves look like the moves of a dancer | They are people who dance on a stage | They wear dancing shoes
